---
source: crates/splot-cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(\"validate\")"
---
Validate an AV2 length-delimited bitstream

Usage: splot validate [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  Path to a raw AV2 Annex B bitstream or IVF-wrapped Annex B stream

Options:
      --json        Emit the validation report as JSON
  -v, --verbose...  Increase logging verbosity (repeatable: -v, -vv, -vvv)
      --quiet       Silence all logging except errors
      --strict      Treat warnings as conformance failures
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version
